    "content": "<p><strong>问题：云店库存和商品列表库存不一致是什么原因呢？（如下图所示）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202508/d29abcaec79eee28f9dd92b3a2dbb3a7.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202508/551ac3f6dd6394d53051359a94c17038.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：云店如果有代发货的订单是会占用云店剩余库存的，需要发货生成销售单才会和商品列表库存一致</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202508/ad1d7a3be5d2c3f3f29898fcce60977f.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202508/c66f3fd14d2cdc43df8fd76dd3c21069.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
